    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 3746487060306571910, guid: 8f20632575e98e546ae250d55e3bdc7a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: message
      value: This is the invisible segment. There are no walls, if you go too far
        in any direction, you'll most likely fall. When you fall you just get teleported
        back while taking a serious damage. You have a navigation helper that is
        activated with 'E'. When you progress, new diamonds will appear on places
        you already visited with a small delay. There are some traps that gets activated
        if you get too close to them. Traps also teleport you. If you get teleported
        via a trap, every progress will be lost. You'll be required to explore this
        maze again. More detailed explanation is in my report.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3779331055973307268, guid: 8f20632575e98e546ae250d55e3bdc7a, type: 3}
